        "original_id": "cefabe38-a969-578c-86e2-bbe593c90763",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Grimes, Donald Malarkey, Steve Smith, Stan Smith\n- Works: ER, Party of Five, Band of Brothers, American Dad!, I Am the Walrus\n- Roles: Dr. Archie Morris, Will McCorkle, Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey\n- Topics: Acting roles, Voice acting, Episode premise\n\nFacts:\n- Scott Grimes appeared in ER as Dr. Archie Morris.\n- Scott Grimes appeared in Party of Five as Will McCorkle.\n- Scott Grimes portrayed Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey in Band of Brothers.\n- Donald Malarkey was portrayed by Scott Grimes in the HBO miniseries Band of Brothers.\n- Scott Grimes voices Steve Smith in American Dad!.\n- The American Dad! episode I Am the Walrus mainly centers on Stan Smith and his son Steve Smith competing for the dominant role in the house.",
